{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01171",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.68,
      "end_seconds": 6.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "Hello, take a seat, I'll be with you in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.27,
      "end_seconds": 12.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "hi doctor, I got here as fast as I could"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.8,
      "end_seconds": 15.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "What do you need help with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.49,
      "end_seconds": 21.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "It's a cut on my finger, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 22.96,
      "end_seconds": 35.58,
      "duration_seconds": 12.62,
      "text": "okay, so the vitals from earlier height 157 centimetres, BP is 123 over 72, BMI works out to 39.8. Heart rate 68, saturation 98 percent, weight 98 kilos"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.44,
      "end_seconds": 41.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Thanks. What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.27,
      "end_seconds": 58.14,
      "duration_seconds": 12.87,
      "text": "Honestly I can't say exactly when it started. It might have been last month or the month before, I really can't pin it down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.93,
      "end_seconds": 62.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.45,
      "end_seconds": 69.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "A little bleeding goes along with it, most of the time"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.82,
      "end_seconds": 76.08,
      "duration_seconds": 6.26,
      "text": "Have you had a cut on your finger before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.19,
      "end_seconds": 86.81,
      "duration_seconds": 9.62,
      "text": "I mean yes something like this happened a couple of years ago and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.74,
      "end_seconds": 90.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Have you noticed numbness or dirty blade?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.02,
      "end_seconds": 98.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "No, not a a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.79,
      "end_seconds": 103.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.19,
      "end_seconds": 107.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "no weakness or anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.22,
      "end_seconds": 114.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "on the cardiac side anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.71,
      "end_seconds": 122.48,
      "duration_seconds": 6.77,
      "text": "so, uh, my heart's been fine, as far as I know"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.61,
      "end_seconds": 126.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Alright anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.08,
      "end_seconds": 130.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Actually just my tonsils removed as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.43,
      "end_seconds": 135.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.69,
      "end_seconds": 139.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "my father has Parkinson's disease"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.99,
      "end_seconds": 143.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "before we go further any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.5,
      "end_seconds": 147.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.67,
      "end_seconds": 169.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.88,
      "end_seconds": 186.12,
      "duration_seconds": 16.24,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure for about a year now. Arthritis in my knees, for nearly five years. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible. Thin bones, for nearly five years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.65,
      "end_seconds": 195.98,
      "duration_seconds": 9.33,
      "text": "yes, carry on yes, high blood pressure and thin bones are known to us, good to have that clear"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.34,
      "end_seconds": 216.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "let's talk a a little about your daily life and habits"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.51,
      "end_seconds": 229.62,
      "duration_seconds": 12.11,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions. I live with my elderly mother. I grab fast food at lunch most days. I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.73,
      "end_seconds": 235.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.14,
      "end_seconds": 246.83,
      "duration_seconds": 9.69,
      "text": "I take metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day for my pressure i take diclofenac, 50 milligrams, when needed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.38,
      "end_seconds": 252.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "now I'm going to do a short physical check"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.67,
      "end_seconds": 256.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Yes, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.44,
      "end_seconds": 258.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.09,
      "end_seconds": 284.03,
      "duration_seconds": 6.94,
      "text": "it's a a clean shallow cut, no longer bleeding, and the finger moves normally"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.41,
      "end_seconds": 289.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Good you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.31,
      "end_seconds": 315.11,
      "duration_seconds": 6.8,
      "text": "so where does that leave us? It points towards a minor clean wound that needs only dressing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.4,
      "end_seconds": 319.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "uh is it dangerous doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.48,
      "end_seconds": 340.81,
      "duration_seconds": 20.33,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency it looks like a minor clean wound that needs only dressing i'll close it with adhesive strips and keep it dry for two days come back or go to emergency straight away if the finger turns red, hot or swollen"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.45,
      "end_seconds": 345.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Erm, I know what to watch for."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.45,
      "end_seconds": 352.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.99,
      "end_seconds": 356.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "okay that makes sense thanks for explaining"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 357.99,
      "end_seconds": 359.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
